---@meta
-- Generated by rs3-api-types from https://developer.runescape.com/rs/game/entity/npcentity.html;
-- regenerate it with ./gradlew generate rather than editing it.

---An `NPCEntity` represents an instance of an NPCType that is currently active in the game world.
---
---See NPCList for information on how to access `NPCEntities`.
---
---Info: An `NPCEntity` is a Proxy usertype, which means it is safe to copy and store in your scripts. It cannot,
---however, be used with any persistent storage.
---
---Warning: Use `NPCEntity.isValid` to confirm that an entity still exists before trying to access its properties.
---Entities can be removed from the client by the server for various reasons, i.e. due to moving beyond the player view
---distance or death. When an entity is removed it will become invalid, and any copies of this usertype should be
---disposed of. If the same entity is re-added to the client by the server, such as walking back into visibility range,
---then a different new NPCEntity will be created.
---
---Information available within an `NPCEntity` includes:
---@class NPCEntity
---@field isValid boolean (Read-only) Whether this entity still exists. Dispose of this usertype object when invalid.
---@field uid integer (Read-only) The unique ID (UID) of this entity.
---@field displayName string (Read-only) The display name of this entity.
---@field config NPCType (Read-only) The config used by this entity.
---@field parentConfig NPCType (Read-only) The parent config used by this entity, if it is a MultiNPC.
---@field configID integer (Read-only) The ID of the config used by this entity.
---@field parentConfigID integer (Read-only) The ID of the parent config used by this entity, if it is a MultiNPC.
---@field isMultiNPC boolean (Read-only) Whether this `NPCEntity` is a MultiNPC.
---@field position Vector3 (Read-only) The world position of this `NPCEntity`.
---@field coordGrid CoordGrid (Read-only) Returns the CoordGrid tile this `NPCEntity` is currently on.
---@field aabb AABB (Read-only) Returns the current bounding box for this `NPCEntity`.
---@field facing integer (Read-only) The current facing angle, in degrees, of this `NPCEntity`.
---@field facingTarget integer (Read-only) The target facing angle, in degrees, of this `NPCEntity`. The `NPCEntity` will be turning towards this angle, if different from `NPCEntity.facing`.
---@field route CoordGrid[] (Read-only) Returns a list of the current coordinates in the `NPCEntity`'s movement route. Returns the current position coordinate if the `NPCEntity` is not moving.
---@field routeEnd CoordGrid? (Read-only) Returns the final coordinate in the `NPCEntity`'s movement route. Returns the current position coordinate if the `NPCEntity` is not moving.
